  "title": "Beef-Stuffed Mushrooms",
  "description": "Beef-stuffed mushrooms feature savory meat and bread mixture seasoned with chili powder and baked into mushroom caps in this favorite hot appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer"
  ],
